Sail: picture-in-picture opens by itself when you switch tabs or when another
app covers the window, on every site, without the allow/block question.
Settings and sail://flags can still turn it off.

Auto picture-in-picture that opened because the window was covered ends
when the user is back in the window, not as soon as it is visible again:
switching desktops shows it for a moment, and the picture-in-picture
window would close and reopen.

